From ba9b81d9dd0788870d1b5ba9e1ec029fffde09d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:07:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! v2: swap CTransaction and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7
 wire format

Restore all27 inherited legacy CLI vectors byte-for-byte from the exact pre-native owner parent. Legacy transaction identity is SHA256d again, and bitcoin-tx continues to create ordinary version2 transactions. Independently checked paired JSON txid/hash/raw-size values against SHA256d of their hex. Complete util CLI test passes; source/reference hashes in final-sweep/cli-legacy-vector-restoration.json. Tier: V2
